            "verseId": "NUM.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kirwor Moses neni ka Obab a lokoku a Reuel a ŋolo arae lokamuran a Moses a ŋolo abunit anakwap a Midian tema, “Awotokin tokona isua nakwap ŋina ikilimokinit isua Ekapolon ebe, ‘Akainakini ayoŋ iyes,’ bua orukosi ka isua, itiyao isua ejok neni kon; anerae iikinit Ekapolon ajokis neni a Ŋisirael.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai tolimok Obab Moses tema, “Nyalosi ayoŋ, nai aboŋori ayoŋ nakwap kaŋ a elope ka loyeneta kaŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema Moses neni ka Obab, “Nyikimyek isua, anerae iyeni iyoŋ neni emaikina isua tolomae analoŋisat ka iruwor iyoŋ eketenan kosi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nabo daŋ kikiruko iyoŋ ka isua, ajokis daadaŋ ŋina itiyae Ekapolon neni kosi, ŋunapei ŋun itiyao isua daŋ neni kon.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
